# Witness statement – Julie Martens (11/03/2026)

Asked by HR about the week of 2 March.

- Marc complained several times that the VPN kept dropping. On Thursday 5 March he told me "I'll just take everything home and do the offers this weekend".
- I did not see him copy files. I never heard him say he wanted to take clients to another company.
- He did say in February that DataNova had approached him and that "the offer was interesting".
- On Friday 6 March Laurent told me "Marc won't be around long, but first he closes his deals".

Julie Martens

