# Statement Jan Peeters (08/06/2026)

- I learned on 5 June that IT had read my whole mailbox, including my "Private" folder. Nobody informed me before or after.
- The journalist is a **personal friend** from university. The e-mails marked PRIVÉ are about dinners and his article on the energy sector.
- I did **not** send him any budget figures. "The numbers we discussed" refers to public energy prices.
- Six people had the budget draft. Why was only my mailbox checked?
- I signed an IT charter saying monitoring follows CCT 81. That was not respected.

