# Request – remote work from Lyon (20/08/2026)

Dear Elke, dear HR,

My partner starts a 4-month assignment in Lyon on 1 October. I would like to work fully remotely from Lyon until 31 January 2027. My work (backend development for the Scheldt Energy project) is 100% remote-compatible; I would come to Brussels for the sprint reviews once a month at my own cost.

I understand that the new policy allows international remote work. Tom already told me on Teams it was fine, so I have signed a lease in Lyon starting 28 September.

Pieter

